"aktualizácii modulu spustite <a href=\"@update-php\">aktualizačný "
"skript</a>."

msgid ""
"If you are upgrading to a newer version of Drupal or upgrading contributed "
"modules or themes, you may need to run the <a href=\"@update-php\">update "
