msgid ""
"Taxonomy is for categorizing content. Terms are grouped into vocabularies. "
"For example, a vocabulary called \"Fruit\" would contain the terms \"Apple\""
" and \"Banana\"."
msgstr ""
"Taxonómia slúži na kategorizáciu obsahu. Termíny sú zoskupené do slovníkov. "
"Napríklad, slovník nazvaný \"Ovocie\" by obsahoval termíny \"Jablko\" a "
"\"Banán\""

msgid ""
"You can reorganize the terms in %capital_name using their drag-and-drop "
"handles, and group terms under a parent term by sliding them under and to "
"the right of the parent."
msgstr ""
"Môžete reorganizovať termíny v kategórii %capital_name spôsobom ťahaj-a-pusť"
" a zoskupiť termíny pod rodičovským termínom potiahnutím termínu dole a "
"doprava pod rodiča."

