msgid ""
"Your web server does not appear to support PDO (PHP Data Objects). Ask your "
"hosting provider if they support the native PDO extension. See the <a "
"href=\"@link\">system requirements</a> page for more information."
msgstr ""
"Zdá sa, že váš webový server nepodporuje PDO (PHP Data Objects). Spýtajte sa"
